a list called lhs is [1, 2, 3].
a list called rhs is [1, 2, 3].
If lhs is equal to rhs then, print "identical lists: equal". Otherwise, print "identical lists: NOT equal".
a map called mapone is {"k": 1}.
a map called maptwo is {"k": 1}.
If mapone is equal to maptwo then, print "identical maps: equal". Otherwise, print "identical maps: NOT equal".
